		(uuid "ce29908e-e898-51df-b56d-73ba9f8aa847")
	)
	(text "Filters (AD7190 weigh-scale application): 100 R + 100 nF differential + 10 nF to ground, the same on the\nreference so input and reference see the same filter. Place the capacitors at the converter.\nAIN1/AIN2 differential (channel 0 of the firmware), reference REFIN1 from the sense lines. MCLK2 takes\nthe shared 4.9152 MHz clock (firmware: external clock), MCLK1 open. BPDSW and P0..P3 unused.\nAGND and DGND join the ground plane at the pins; decoupling at the pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.75 147 0)
		(effects
